    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>theBOLL</strong> is an arcade platformer with realistic physics, tight mechanics, and a bit of personality. It\u2019s just you, the level, and one goal \u2014 roll to the end. Or slow down and explore every corner in search of hidden secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR BALL, YOUR RULES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re just a ball \u2014 and that\u2019s the point. No distractions. Just you, gravity, and the path you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/78952e53cba45f2825ba306636c4f43e.poster.avif?t=1751062459\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/78952e53cba45f2825ba306636c4f43e.webm?t=1751062459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/78952e53cba45f2825ba306636c4f43e.mp4?t=1751062459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REALISTIC PHYSICS, SIMPLE CONTROLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, roll, slide \u2014 everything feels natural. The challenge isn\u2019t in the buttons, but in the levels. Easy to pick up, hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/ed956a5def4fec8dda5816920104bdc4.poster.avif?t=1751062459\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/ed956a5def4fec8dda5816920104bdc4.webm?t=1751062459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/ed956a5def4fec8dda5816920104bdc4.mp4?t=1751062459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A CHILL WAY TO PLAY \u2014 WITH SECRETS TO FIND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not into racing the clock? That\u2019s fine. Take your time, explore, and look for hidden stuff. There are plenty of secrets \u2014 some of them quite unexpected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/c6c379a33b558de31b644eb462ccffee.poster.avif?t=1751062459\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/c6c379a33b558de31b644eb462ccffee.webm?t=1751062459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/c6c379a33b558de31b644eb462ccffee.mp4?t=1751062459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEVELS BUILT FOR SPEEDRUNS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No scripts. No randomness. Just you and precision. Every level can be beaten faster \u2014 sometimes <i>a lot</i> faster \u2014 if you find the right line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/6e6e0e9f7570dfc1ca185fc79628a59b.poster.avif?t=1751062459\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/6e6e0e9f7570dfc1ca185fc79628a59b.webm?t=1751062459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/6e6e0e9f7570dfc1ca185fc79628a59b.mp4?t=1751062459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GLOBAL LEADERBOARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to know how good you really are? The rankings will show you. Or remind you there\u2019s always someone quicker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/0ecbfdceaf294e53c12947ac52311aa4.poster.avif?t=1751062459\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/0ecbfdceaf294e53c12947ac52311aa4.webm?t=1751062459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/0ecbfdceaf294e53c12947ac52311aa4.mp4?t=1751062459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>theBOLL</strong> is an arcade platformer with realistic physics, tight mechanics, and a bit of personality. It\u2019s just you, the level, and one goal \u2014 roll to the end. Or slow down and explore every corner in search of hidden secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR BALL, YOUR RULES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re just a ball \u2014 and that\u2019s the point. No distractions. Just you, gravity, and the path you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/78952e53cba45f2825ba306636c4f43e.poster.avif?t=1751062459\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/78952e53cba45f2825ba306636c4f43e.webm?t=1751062459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/78952e53cba45f2825ba306636c4f43e.mp4?t=1751062459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REALISTIC PHYSICS, SIMPLE CONTROLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, roll, slide \u2014 everything feels natural. The challenge isn\u2019t in the buttons, but in the levels. Easy to pick up, hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/ed956a5def4fec8dda5816920104bdc4.poster.avif?t=1751062459\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/ed956a5def4fec8dda5816920104bdc4.webm?t=1751062459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/ed956a5def4fec8dda5816920104bdc4.mp4?t=1751062459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A CHILL WAY TO PLAY \u2014 WITH SECRETS TO FIND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not into racing the clock? That\u2019s fine. Take your time, explore, and look for hidden stuff. There are plenty of secrets \u2014 some of them quite unexpected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/c6c379a33b558de31b644eb462ccffee.poster.avif?t=1751062459\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/c6c379a33b558de31b644eb462ccffee.webm?t=1751062459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/c6c379a33b558de31b644eb462ccffee.mp4?t=1751062459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEVELS BUILT FOR SPEEDRUNS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No scripts. No randomness. Just you and precision. Every level can be beaten faster \u2014 sometimes <i>a lot</i> faster \u2014 if you find the right line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/6e6e0e9f7570dfc1ca185fc79628a59b.poster.avif?t=1751062459\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/6e6e0e9f7570dfc1ca185fc79628a59b.webm?t=1751062459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/6e6e0e9f7570dfc1ca185fc79628a59b.mp4?t=1751062459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GLOBAL LEADERBOARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to know how good you really are? The rankings will show you. Or remind you there\u2019s always someone quicker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/0ecbfdceaf294e53c12947ac52311aa4.poster.avif?t=1751062459\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/0ecbfdceaf294e53c12947ac52311aa4.webm?t=1751062459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/0ecbfdceaf294e53c12947ac52311aa4.mp4?t=1751062459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>",
